🎨 WEBSITE DESIGN DOCUMENT

Project: NCS Santhanam – Premium Silk Boutique Website
Design Inspiration: Modern Luxury Fashion Editorial
Reference Style: Minimal, high-end, calm, confident (as per shared image)

1️⃣ DESIGN VISION & STATEMENT

“A digital silk showroom that feels timeless, elegant, and expensive.”

The website should:

Feel like a luxury fashion magazine

Communicate heritage without heaviness

Use silence, space, and confidence instead of noise

Let products breathe and speak

This is not a discount-driven ecommerce site.
This is a brand-first luxury experience.

2️⃣ OVERALL LOOK & FEEL
Keywords (very important for alignment)

Timeless

Editorial

Calm

Sophisticated

Premium

Minimal

Heritage × Modern

❌ Avoid:

Loud colors

Multiple banners

Flashy animations

Cluttered sections

Cheap gradients

3️⃣ COLOR SYSTEM (FROM REFERENCE IMAGE)
Primary Palette

Warm Ivory / Off-white → Main background

Soft Greige / Light Beige → Secondary background

Charcoal Black → Headings & body text

Muted Gold / Bronze → Accent (lines, icons, hover)

🎯 Rule:

Backgrounds must always feel soft, never pure white.

4️⃣ TYPOGRAPHY SYSTEM
Heading Font (Luxury Serif)

Used for:

Hero headline

Section titles

Collection names

Style characteristics:

Thin strokes

High contrast

Elegant letter spacing

(Example style: Playfair / Canela / Cormorant-style)

Body Font (Clean Sans-serif)

Used for:

Descriptions

Product details

Buttons

Navigation

Style characteristics:

Simple

Neutral

Highly readable

🎯 Rule:

Serif = Emotion
Sans = Clarity

5️⃣ LAYOUT PRINCIPLES (CRITICAL)

Inspired directly by the shared image:

✔ White Space is a Feature

Large margins

Generous padding

Fewer sections per page

✔ Asymmetry

Image on one side, text on the other

Not everything centered

Editorial magazine feel

✔ Large Typography

Headlines must feel bold through size, not weight

6️⃣ HEADER & NAVIGATION DESIGN
Header Style

Transparent or soft background

Minimal height

No heavy borders

Navigation Items

What’s New

Shop

Collections

Our Story

Contact

🧠 Rule:

Fewer menu items = higher class

7️⃣ HOMEPAGE DESIGN STRUCTURE
🔝 Hero Section (MOST IMPORTANT)

Design:

Full-width

One powerful lifestyle image

Model wearing premium attire OR silk close-up

Calm neutral background

Text Style (like reference):

Large serif headline

One short supporting line

Two subtle buttons

Buttons:

Primary: Solid dark

Secondary: Outline / ghost

❌ No sliders
❌ No multiple banners

🧵 Collections Section

Design:

Grid of large image cards

2 or 3 columns max

Minimal text overlay

Example:

Wedding Silks

Kanchipuram Classics

Soft Silks

Gift Collections

Hover effect:

Slight zoom

Soft fade text

🏛 Brand Story Section

Purpose: Trust + Legacy

Design:

One heritage image (store / loom / silk texture)

Serif heading

Short emotional paragraph

Tone:

“Crafted with care. Rooted in tradition. Designed for generations.”

🛍 Featured Products

Design:

Clean grid

No borders

Large images

Price in subtle font

Hover:

Image zoom

“View Details” fade-in

8️⃣ PRODUCT PAGE DESIGN
Image Area

Takes 60–70% width

Zoom-on-hover

Multiple angles

Content Area

Product name (serif)

Price (calm, confident)

Short refined description

Fabric / Occasion / Care

Buttons

Add to Cart → Dark, solid

Buy Now → Outline

❌ No blinking offers
❌ No aggressive badges

Luxury does not shout.

9️⃣ INTERACTIONS & ANIMATIONS
Animation Style

Slow

Smooth

Fade + slide

Ease-in-out

Examples:

Section fade-in on scroll

Button hover soft glow

Image zoom 1–2%

❌ Bounce animations
❌ Fast transitions

🔟 MOBILE DESIGN PHILOSOPHY

Mobile should feel:

Like a luxury fashion app

Thumb-friendly

Scroll-focused

Rules:

Sticky bottom “Add to Cart”

Large tappable areas

No overcrowding

1️⃣1️⃣ IMAGERY GUIDELINES
Photography Style

Natural lighting

Neutral backgrounds

Lifestyle + fabric close-ups

Editorial poses

❌ Over-saturated images
❌ Studio white backgrounds only